            <div class="sn-faq-head">
              <p class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU GO</p>
              <h2>Questions before you order.</h2>
              <p class="section-intro">Quick checks on engine compatibility, 160 PSI inflation, clamp safety, and PD 45W recharging.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sn-faq-list" data-progressive-faq>
              <details data-faq-id="b21ap-q1">
                <summary>Will B21AP start a dead V8 truck or diesel SUV?</summary>
                <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. B21AP delivers 5,000A peak (2,500A starting) current, rated for 12V vehicles up to 9.0L gas or 6.0L diesel in operating temperatures from −20°C to 75°C (−4°F to 167°F). Never use it on 24V vehicles.</p></div>
              </details>
              <details class="faq-related" data-faq-parent="b21ap-q1" hidden>
                <summary>Can I carry the 20,000mAh B21AP in luggage or keep it in my car year-round?</summary>
                <div class="faq-answer"><p>Its rated battery energy is 74Wh (below the standard 100Wh FAA cabin carry-on limit; always check your airline before flying). Keep it in your trunk or glove area within −20°C to 75°C operating limits and top off every 3 months.</p></div>
              </details>

              <details data-faq-id="b21ap-q2">
                <summary>How fast does the 160 PSI compressor inflate a car tire, and does it shut off automatically?</summary>
                <div class="faq-answer"><p>It fills a typical car tire from 0 to 35 PSI in roughly 5 minutes. Select a preset (Car, Motorcycle, Bike, Ball) or dial in a custom PSI / BAR / KPA / kg/cm² target, and it stops automatically when reached.</p></div>
              </details>
              <details class="faq-related" data-faq-parent="b21ap-q2" hidden>
                <summary>How fast does B21AP recharge, and can it charge laptops or phones?</summary>
                <div class="faq-answer"><p>Two-way USB-C PD 45W recharges devices rapidly and tops up B21AP from empty in around 2 hours with a compatible 45W PD wall adapter, alongside an 18W USB-A port.</p></div>
              </details>

              <details data-faq-id="b21ap-q3">
                <summary>What happens if I accidentally connect the jumper clamps backward?</summary>
                <div class="faq-answer"><p>The spark-proof smart clamps detect reverse polarity or short circuits before sending power, blocking output and alerting you immediately with the indicator light and buzzer.</p></div>
              </details>
              <details class="faq-related" data-faq-parent="b21ap-q3" hidden>
                <summary>What accessories and warranty are included with B21AP?</summary>
                <div class="faq-answer"><p>Included: B21AP unit, heavy-duty smart clamps, braided air hose, 4 nozzle adapters, USB-C charging cable, EVA hard carrying case, user manual, and a 2-year manufacturer warranty.</p></div>
              </details>
            </div>
